{"id":"ef7d98ff0e474432","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-nonreflecting.md","title":"Nonreflecting Stationary Set","display":"df-nonreflecting — Nonreflecting Stationary Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-nonreflecting","aliases":["58-df-nonreflecting"],"display":"df-nonreflecting — Nonreflecting Stationary Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-stationary]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]","[[58-df-club]]","[[58-df-limitordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-nonreflecting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-nonreflecting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nonreflecting — Nonreflecting Stationary Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"58-df-stationary\">58-df-stationary</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"58-df-club\">58-df-club</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (uncountable regular cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(S\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span> (stationary set candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}\\)</span> (cofinality function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\alpha)\\)</span> (club predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"58-df-club\">58-df-club</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonRef}\">\\(\\mathrm{NonRef}\\)</span> (nonreflection predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DoesNotReflectTo}\">\\(\\operatorname{DoesNotReflectTo}\\)</span> (nonreflection-at-ordinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stationary}\">\\(\\operatorname{Stationary}\\)</span> (stationarity predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonreflecting} \\vdash \\operatorname{DoesNotReflectTo}(S,\\alpha) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\omega&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)\\land\\exists C\\subseteq\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\alpha)\\land C\\cap S=\\emptyset\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonreflecting} \\vdash \\operatorname{DoesNotReflectTo}(S,\\alpha) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\omega&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)\\land\\exists C\\subseteq\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\alpha)\\land C\\cap S=\\emptyset\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonreflecting\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{NonRef}(S,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land \\forall \\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\omega&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha))\\to \\operatorname{DoesNotReflectTo}(S,\\alpha)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nonreflecting\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{NonRef}(S,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\operatorname{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\land \\forall \\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\omega&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha))\\to \\operatorname{DoesNotReflectTo}(S,\\alpha)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A nonreflecting stationary set remains nonstationary at every initial segment of uncountable cofinality below its ambient regular cardinal; the reflection point need not itself be a cardinal.</li>\n<li>Used in constructing examples of combinatorial principles.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}